          "score": 0.7944188,
          "content": "Open the agentic chat sidebar, switch to **Code mode**, and run the following prompt to have Bob edit the `README.md`. Bob may make suggestions such as enhance with better troubleshooting, complete overhaul, or fix inaccuracies. You can pick the suggestion that best fits your vision for the README.\n\n```text\nUpdate the readme\n```\n\nBob updates the `README.md` and creates a folder called `internal-monologue` and creates a file that shows you the updates it made to the README.\n\n![Bob updates the README.md and creates an internal monologue file](/images/update_to_readme.png)",
